  "result": "I fixed it in `src/lib/csv.ts:10`. I haven't run the tests.\n\n**Cause:** the export only puts quotes around a field if it contains a comma or a line break. A title with a `\"` in it but no comma went out without the surrounding quotes. The code already doubles any `\"` inside a field, but that only works when the whole field is quoted, so the spreadsheet read the bare quotes as the start or end of a field and shifted the columns. That's why titles with commas came out fine.\n\n**Fix:** the check now treats a double quote as a reason to quote the field, as the CSV standard requires: `const NEEDS_QUOTING = /[\",\\r\\n]/;`. The activity/audit-log export uses the same code, so it's fixed too.",
